{"id":"forderung","lemma":"Forderung","pos":"noun","rank":3887,"glosses":["a demand, a (financial) claim","call (i.e., decision made publicly)"],"ipa":"/ˈfɔʁdəʁʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/De-Forderung.ogg/De-Forderung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Forderung","plural":"Forderungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Unsere Forderungen sind einfach.","en":"Our demands are simple.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"easy"}]},{"text":"Ich habe noch eine weitere Forderung.","en":"I have one more demand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756630","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"wide","l":"weit"},null]},{"text":"Gib diesen Forderungen nicht nach!","en":"Do not give in to those demands.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"after / to"}]},{"text":"Er kam endlich meinen Forderungen nach.","en":"He finally met my demands.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"eventually"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},null,{"g":"after / to"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte diese Forderung nicht ablehnen.","en":"I do not want to reject this claim.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to decline"}]}]}